  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda REDD+ Results-Based Payments for results period 2016 - 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening of forest-related policy implementation including the strengthened governmental financial and technical capacity and leads to the strengthening of law enforcement capacities of relevant agencies, supporting an effective MRV system, environmental and social management and safeguards monitoring and reporting, and for continuous and effective engagement of stakeholders in the territory. The project will provide support to communities for forest conservation, sustainable management and restoration, contributing to mitigation and adaptation impacts.</narrative>
  </description>
